      item2:
        'The import from your CRM starts on its own when you connect, with progress per object, and your correction always wins over the CRM’s: the difference is proposed to you.',
      item3:
        'Sync runs every 15 minutes (a full pass at night) and the CRM card shows “Synced N min ago”; reading modifications now covers every connected CRM.',
      item4:
        'Sending to the CRM: the dialog shows what is already there before writing, and the connection works whichever region your account is in.',
