        'In /chat, “find me accounts in industry” prepares the account search instead of going to the web; the CSV or spreadsheet export of a ranking now carries its facts (rank, level, not evaluated, dated source); a Laura thread exports as “Excerpt” or “Full thread”, in Markdown or PDF.',
