      item4:
        'R22-FIX: the “Deals to qualify” card is told apart from leads, a mission name wraps without an ellipsis, the Owner column reads the right name, a project panel shows the same amount as the list, “created” only counts created deals and Qualification says “not measured” when no BTMMP is entered.',
