      item2:
        'When your question calls for a commercial decision (open an account, compare, place a consultant) and Laura answers with no tool result this turn, she adds a clarification: check it before quoting it.',
      item3:
        'If the public registry is down, the account search leans on the already-qualified accounts of your workspace beyond the usual top-up — the outage is still stated, and so is the provenance.',
