      date: 'September 30, 2026',
      title: 'Read the brief as another role',
      item1:
        'In the demo room, "Today" offers "Read as": executive, manager, sales or recruiter. The same cards, in that role’s order — the recruiter opens on availabilities and replies. Only the order changes, never the content.',
