      title: 'The talent pool now imports CVs from a ZIP archive or an email',
      item1:
        'From the talent pool, a whole ZIP archive of CVs imports in one go: every file follows the same automatic intake (a reliable profile updates itself, an ambiguous one is set aside for your review), and the result says how many profiles came in, how many failed, and why — the per-archive file limit is announced before you send it.',
      item2:
        'A CV received by email now imports directly from a thread in your connected mailbox, without leaving the talent pool — the control only appears when a mailbox is actually connected.',
